{
  "title": { "zh": "很多场景，同一张图", "en": "Many scenes, one picture" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "投影把场景变成图，方向是正的：给定场景，图就定了，这是图形学的方向。视觉反过来，手里只有图，要说出场景（<wiki-ref to=\"vision-task-outputs\"></wiki-ref>有类别、位置、每个像素的标签等各种形式）。",
        "en": "Projection turns a scene into a picture, the forward way: given the scene, the picture is settled, as in graphics. Vision goes back, from the picture to the scene (its <wiki-ref to=\"vision-task-outputs\"></wiki-ref> take many forms: a class, a location, a label per pixel)."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关的问题是：从一张图倒推回去，场景能定下来吗？先用投影的关系找出成一样大的像的物体，再判断关于一张图里的场景，哪些话一定成立、哪些一定不成立、哪些定不下来。",
        "en": "This level asks: going back from a picture, is the scene settled? First use the projection relation to find objects that image equally tall; then judge which statements about a pictured scene must hold, must fail, or cannot be settled."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "这是<wiki-ref to=\"forward-vs-inverse-problem\"></wiki-ref>：投影丢了深度，大而远和小而近拍出同一张图，从图推场景常有不止一个答案。",
    "en": "This is the <wiki-ref to=\"forward-vs-inverse-problem\"></wiki-ref>: projection drops depth; big-and-far pictures like small-and-near, so a picture often has more than one scene behind it."
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "1A2",
      "kind": "choice",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "f = 2：选出像高都是 1、距离各不相同的两组以上。",
        "en": "f = 2: choose two or more pairs that all image 1 tall, at different distances."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "像高 h = fH/Z。物高和距离一起翻倍，h 怎样变？",
          "en": "The image height is h = fH/Z. When height and distance both double, what happens to h?"
        }
      ],
      "judge": { "project": { "f": 2, "target": 1 } },
      "rounds": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "哪几组的像高都是 1、距离又各不相同？",
                "en": "Which pairs all image 1 tall, at different distances?"
              }
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            { "id": "a", "label": { "zh": "红箱：高 1，距离 2", "en": "Red crate: 1 tall, 2 away" }, "H": 1, "Z": 2 },
            { "id": "b", "label": { "zh": "蓝箱：高 2，距离 4", "en": "Blue crate: 2 tall, 4 away" }, "H": 2, "Z": 4 },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "label": { "zh": "黄箱：高 2，距离 2", "en": "Yellow crate: 2 tall, 2 away" },
              "H": 2,
              "Z": 2
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "label": { "zh": "绿箱：高 3，距离 5", "en": "Green crate: 3 tall, 5 away" },
              "H": 3,
              "Z": 5
            },
            {
              "id": "e",
              "label": { "zh": "白箱：高 1.5，距离 3", "en": "White crate: 1.5 tall, 3 away" },
              "H": 1.5,
              "Z": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "换一批：哪几组的像高都是 1、距离又各不相同？",
                "en": "Another set: which pairs all image 1 tall, at different distances?"
              }
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": { "zh": "灯塔模型：高 0.5，距离 1", "en": "Model lighthouse: 0.5 tall, 1 away" },
              "H": 0.5,
              "Z": 1
            },
            { "id": "b", "label": { "zh": "灯塔：高 4，距离 8", "en": "Lighthouse: 4 tall, 8 away" }, "H": 4, "Z": 8 },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "label": { "zh": "路灯：高 3，距离 9", "en": "Street lamp: 3 tall, 9 away" },
              "H": 3,
              "Z": 9
            },
            { "id": "d", "label": { "zh": "烟囱：高 5，距离 10", "en": "Chimney: 5 tall, 10 away" }, "H": 5, "Z": 10 },
            { "id": "e", "label": { "zh": "电线杆：高 3，距离 6", "en": "Pole: 3 tall, 6 away" }, "H": 3, "Z": 6 }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "naive": {
        "picks": [[["b", "c"]], [["c", "e"]]],
        "why": {
          "zh": "挑了一样高的物体：可像高还取决于距离，高 2 的箱子在距离 2 处成的像高 2。成一样高的像的，是 H/Z 相同的那些。",
          "en": "That picks objects of one height, but the image also depends on distance: the crate 2 tall at distance 2 images 2 tall. Equal images come from equal H/Z."
        }
      },
      "step": { "zh": "一样高的像", "en": "Equal images" }
    },
    {
      "id": "1A2_2",
      "kind": "choice",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "判断关于场景的每句话：成立、不成立，还是无法确定。",
        "en": "Judge each statement about the scene: supported, contradicted, or undetermined."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "给出的场景只是渲得出这张图的场景之一。把红色立方体放大一倍、再推远一倍，图会变吗？",
          "en": "The scene given is only one that renders this picture. Double the red cube's size and its distance: does the picture change?"
        },
        {
          "zh": "一张图只定下每个物体的 H/Z。红色立方体的 H 知道了，它的 Z 呢？蓝色立方体的呢？",
          "en": "An image fixes only each object's H/Z. With the red cube's H known, what about its Z? And the blue cube's?"
        }
      ],
      "judge": "claims",
      "rounds": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "红色立方体离相机 6 米。", "en": "The red cube is 6 m from the camera." },
              "claim": { "depth": { "object": "red", "z": 6, "tol": 0.05 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "右边的立方体是蓝色的。", "en": "The cube on the right is blue." },
              "claim": { "colour": { "object": "blue", "is": "blue" } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "场景里有两个立方体。", "en": "The scene has two cubes." },
              "claim": { "count": { "class": "cube", "n": 2 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "红色立方体边长 1 米。", "en": "The red cube is 1 m on a side." },
              "claim": { "height": { "object": "red", "h": 1, "tol": 0.05 } }
            }
          ],
          "scenes": [
            {
              "size": [32, 24],
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 6, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 60 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "red",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-0.9, 0.5, 0], "size": [1, 1, 1] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "blue",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "blue",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.9, 0.3, -0.5], "size": [0.6, 0.6, 0.6] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": [32, 24],
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 6, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 60 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "red",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-1.8, 0.5, -6], "size": [2, 2, 2] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "blue",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "blue",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [1.8, 0.1, -7], "size": [1.2, 1.2, 1.2] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": [32, 24],
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 6, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 60 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "red",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-2.7, 0.5, -12], "size": [3, 3, 3] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "blue",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "blue",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [2.7, -0.1, -13.5], "size": [1.8, 1.8, 1.8] }]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "given": {
            "zh": "渲得出这张图的场景之一：红色立方体边长 1 米、离相机 6 米；蓝色立方体边长 0.6 米、离相机 6.5 米。",
            "en": "One scene that renders this picture: the red cube 1 m on a side and 6 m from the camera; the blue cube 0.6 m on a side and 6.5 m away."
          }
        },
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "红色立方体离相机 6 米。", "en": "The red cube is 6 m from the camera." },
              "claim": { "depth": { "object": "red", "z": 6, "tol": 0.05 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "蓝色立方体离相机 6.5 米。", "en": "The blue cube is 6.5 m from the camera." },
              "claim": { "depth": { "object": "blue", "z": 6.5, "tol": 0.05 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "蓝色立方体边长 0.6 米。", "en": "The blue cube is 0.6 m on a side." },
              "claim": { "height": { "object": "blue", "h": 0.6, "tol": 0.05 } }
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "红色立方体离相机 3 米。", "en": "The red cube is 3 m from the camera." },
              "claim": { "depth": { "object": "red", "z": 3, "tol": 0.05 } }
            }
          ],
          "scenes": [
            {
              "size": [32, 24],
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 6, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 60 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "red",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-0.9, 0.5, 0], "size": [1, 1, 1] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "blue",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "blue",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [0.9, 0.3, -0.5], "size": [0.6, 0.6, 0.6] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": [32, 24],
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 6, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 60 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "red",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-0.9, 0.5, 0], "size": [1, 1, 1] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "blue",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "blue",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [1.8, 0.1, -7], "size": [1.2, 1.2, 1.2] }]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "size": [32, 24],
              "camera": { "yaw": 0, "pitch": 0, "distance": 6, "f": 1 },
              "light": { "azimuth": 30, "elevation": 60 },
              "objects": [
                {
                  "id": "red",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "red",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [-0.9, 0.5, 0], "size": [1, 1, 1] }]
                },
                {
                  "id": "blue",
                  "class": "cube",
                  "colour": "blue",
                  "boxes": [{ "at": [2.7, -0.1, -13.5], "size": [1.8, 1.8, 1.8] }]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "given": {
            "zh": "图和上一轮相同，上一轮给出的场景也渲得出它。这一轮多知道一件事：红色立方体的边长确实是 1 米。",
            "en": "The picture is the last round's, and the scene given there still renders it. This round you also know: the red cube really is 1 m on a side."
          }
        }
      ],
      "naive": {
        "picks": [
          [["supported"], ["supported"], ["supported"], ["supported"]],
          [["supported"], ["supported"], ["supported"], ["contradicted"]]
        ],
        "why": {
          "zh": "把给出的那个场景当成了真实的场景：可放大一倍又推远一倍的场景渲出同一张图，一张图只定下每个物体的 H/Z。知道红色立方体边长 1 米，按 H/Z 定下它离相机 6 米；蓝色立方体的边长不知道，它的距离和大小仍然定不了。",
          "en": "That takes the scene given as the real one, but a scene scaled up and pushed back as much renders the same picture: an image fixes only each object's H/Z. Knowing the red cube is 1 m fixes its distance at 6 m by H/Z; the blue cube's size is unknown, so its distance and size stay open."
        }
      },
      "step": { "zh": "一张图能说明什么", "en": "What a picture settles" }
    }
  ]
}
